{"server":"tw","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_07_beg","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_07","title":"生靈火花","storyCode":"FC-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2e012245d243edb7357c99e54df6c27502016a691990e210ac11683edfc2707b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"塔拉人的呼喚讓葦草堅定了信念，眾人協力從苦戰中脫身。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕的詩人啊，我無法給你答案。讓後來的人回答吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，今晚我還有一件重要的事情必須告訴各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這恐怕是我們“塔拉人之家”最後一次相聚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風趣的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，伯爵閣下，您在說什麼呢？我們的事業，難道不是剛剛開始嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用害怕，塔拉人尋找自我的事業，的確剛剛開始。將要消失的，只是我個人主導的小小集會而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你說是嗎，我忠心耿耿的侍從？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯爵侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，閣下，我只是個僕人，不懂這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯爵侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面雪已經很大了，您的身體不好......我隨時為您備車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威廉姆斯先生，你願意陪我在這風雪天裡走一段路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"......榮幸之至，閣下。我寄身的旅社，原本也沒有柴火，風雪天不是大礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？......是啊，我沒有阻止議會實施針對塔拉人街區的冬季稅務法令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣陰冷的天氣，是應該有一簇火的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，也許我們可以再聊一聊你的劇作，還有你自鄉間採擷的故事，以及塔拉本來應有的模樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜，你們聽到那個過來的腳步聲了嗎？那麼重，是不好對付的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走走走，我們往另一個方向躲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"篝火還在燃燒......我可以去抽一根木柴做火把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，等會我跟你去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——葦草！聽得到嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有回應......這邊，往這邊躲！等下我們分兩隊去找她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算找不到葦草，也要找到風笛和陳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你們敢干擾軍方的行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？躲不掉就打，我又不是沒跟你們維多利亞的軍人交過手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"narration","text":"“葦草”。\n一遍又一遍的呼喊，穿越了煙塵與濃霧。\n葦草知道自己該去哪個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不該被捲入這場紛爭。我得去幫他們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺憾，刺偏了一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我不記得我曾將這件事彙報給領袖之外的任何人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總不會天真地以為，深池之中只有你一人組織了自己的情報網。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要動手把那個傀儡帶回來，眼下恐怕也沒有比我的部隊更適合調動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，那我真是感激不盡......你想監督我辦事？還是想自己動手除掉她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她不再甘於影子的身份，我的劍比你的法術更快一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經看夠了無主的維多利亞人心各異，這樣的鬧劇，沒有必要在深池繼續上演。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你動身來追殺我了......深池是不是，已經準備好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是僅剩的不穩定因素。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為作為一個傀儡，你至少也學會了裝模作樣地思考，能夠將目光放得更長遠一些，但你的愚善實在令人失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你從一開始就按照鬼魂部隊的行動準則，清除所有目擊證人，事情本來不會一錯再錯，發展到現在的局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二道傷口。不足以影響一條德拉克的行動能力，但你應該知道，哪怕沒有其他深池士兵趕來，這仍然是一邊倒的戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不出你有什麼資格向領袖舉起反旗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊、啊呀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......那些塔拉平民在這個方向。風笛和葦草聽到喊聲，一定也會往這邊突破。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堅持一下！我這就來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陳？太好了，總算有個人答應了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好快的動作！從哪裡出手的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔，陳警司。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陳循聲一劍刺去，劍刃卻只陷入濃濃的迷霧。\n她感到一絲寒意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您是否想過，自己對維多利亞的軍隊出手，會給魏彥吾造成怎樣的影響？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想做就做了，跟他有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只為救那些被捲入紛爭的無辜人，你們要借外交手段對我指手畫腳，先看看自己行得正不正。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您或許想掩蓋事情的複雜性，不過，我這裡有一個您不必急於回答的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您為什麼來維多利亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，您是為誰而來到維多利亞？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的出身，我的家族，或者我個人的恩怨，都與我們眼下的紛爭無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你怎麼疑神疑鬼，現在，我只會用我手中這把劍回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到你了，菲舍爾先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎不是來和平溝通的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池的部隊就在眼前，誰是你的敵人應該一目了然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，可我現在的任務是救人......你提前佈置好了隊伍，又有源石技藝掩護，我們不清除掉這裡的霧氣的話，沒辦法突破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可以試試阻止我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接擊倒她，不要浪費時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......要是有彈藥就好了，應對好幾個人的情況還是挺麻煩的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......風暴突擊隊第二分隊隊員，菲奧娜·楊，代號“風笛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看過你寫的每一份關於小丘郡事件的報告書，對於你的行動，我發自內心地尊敬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以，我們應該選擇聯手，而不是爭鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你始終在追查小丘郡事件的真相，那麼在這裡俘虜一些深池士兵後，我們可以按照正規流程審訊，得到你想要的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是算啦。我不擅長分辨別人是不是在說謊，審訊方面的技巧也掌握得不是很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為表誠意，我可以先送你一條資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赤鐵近衛隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他們是什麼人吧？你再留意一下——今夜出現在這裡的深池士兵的作戰方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，剛剛視野好像清晰了一下......對你來說，保持這樣的源石技藝，應該負荷很大吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有大到會影響我計劃的程度。當然，我也不會容許任何人破壞我的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以認為，這是我們這些情報人員的戰爭......為了保證真正的戰爭不會爆發，千萬人能平靜地生活，我一步也不會走錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，任務完成有好壞之分，對錯卻很難判斷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......石塊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，維恩先生！你怎麼一個人跑到這裡來了？這裡很危險！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也不知道，就是在濃霧裡迷路了，哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，這裡真的很危險！快離開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這我知道......可我得幫忙。他們還有人在更危險的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事，我能行的，你千萬不要擔心我。我一鋤頭能砸倒一個人呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們，就拿著撿來的斷劍和卷了刃的刀，憑什麼能攔我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你要去抓我們的領袖，我憑什麼不攔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖？你們果然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是一夥的？是啊，不然我們幹嘛要來救她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能打，還能在逃跑的時候給我們領路，我們沒她可不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......想背後偷襲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹得好，莫蘭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這把廢刀刺不穿軟甲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別，別用火把去燒，那根木柴都沒塗油，很容易滅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她只看到火燙傷了士兵的手臂，士兵揮動軍刀，臉上的表情混合著憤怒與痛苦。\n軍刀擦著她的手劃過，被砍斷的木柴掉在泥地上，冒出一陣煙，緩緩熄滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......這樣也還不錯，這傢伙揮刀都不利索了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，我抓著你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......你的刀，你還能握住多久？別勉強自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"可笑，你除了一味招架，還能做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞爾蒙，留下我就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到有幾個人來了，是不是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔拉人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們？是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我這身衣服是從死人身上撿的，我跟你們不是一起的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，塔拉人，快去安全的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我從來沒有說過，我要與她為敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她犯下的過錯，我想替她改，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在戰爭面前，追尋道德上的完美？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就做你的懦夫和偽君子吧。像在小丘郡的時候一樣被脅迫，像在半島郡的時候一樣受背叛吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍刃撕開夜風，尖銳的金屬碰撞聲和軍官的質疑聲，一併刺向葦草。\n但她沒有去聽。她聽見風中更加刺耳的悲號。\n她知道手無寸鐵的塔拉人正在這場爭奪中流血，倒下。\n她能叫出每一個痛呼者的名字，在幾個小時前曾聽那些聲音唱過故鄉的民謠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她只是，聽不到這些哭聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有問過自己，你們要救的塔拉人是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......小心葦草的源石技藝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她現在，很有力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這火焰，就好像不屬於她自己一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德拉克的火焰，很漂亮吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......並未超出我的預期，阿赫茉妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這裡還有一位被火焰表演驚呆了的可憐人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，你還不認識我，就像你也從來沒好好認識過你身邊的那位朋友一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也多謝你這麼努力地與這個維多利亞人的隊伍纏鬥，現在他的源石技藝已經不足以影響我的後續追擊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就像在小丘郡的時候一樣。你們越是英勇，我越感到惋惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的戰鬥已經結束了，你們走吧，深池不會傷害你們......甚至可以護送你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她在說什麼呀？風笛，你認識她？那我們是打她還是不打？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找葦草。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你對她很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她身邊沒有那個塔拉人，我當然會選擇滅口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是她能讓我們的德拉克意識到，除了深池，自己不會有容身之處，那當然更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你們的武裝力量似乎集中到了我這個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，那個可憐的孩子在我們的追趕下，往西北方向逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，那邊很快就會進入威靈頓公爵的核心領地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那裡，她的一切行動都會處在深池的控制之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而當務之急......是把知道太多的人都清掃乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你活著能傳回的情報，並不比你的死亡本身能言說的訊息多多少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞爾蒙，慢一點......我有點跟不上。我們現在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概從紮營的地方往樹林裡跑了兩百米吧。哈，剛剛那個士兵被我們打退了，現在也沒人追上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......到了安全的地方，我處理一下傷口，然後再回頭叫其他人朝這個方向走，來接應你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像維恩那種沒什麼本事的人，就不該在戰場上浪費時間，該讓我這種能打的去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，你也比他能打多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞爾蒙，身後有很大的聲音，發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能......隱約看到一點亮光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你看不清真是可惜了。那一定是葦草用法術點起來的火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很壯觀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實，我早就知道她有那個本事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......荒野上的夜晚，原來這麼冷啊......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她們的步伐終於慢了下來，莫蘭不再被拽得踉踉蹌蹌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞爾蒙，我們到安全的地方了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕壞消息......告訴我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她們向前走著。在風聲、遙遠的爆炸聲與叫喊聲之間，莫蘭努力分辨著塞爾蒙的聲音。\n那一刻應該有預兆。塞爾蒙應該停下腳步，說些什麼，或者至少，對塔拉人的命運報以她輕蔑的笑聲。\n但莫蘭只感覺到，在邁出某一步時，拉著自己向前走的手，驀地向下一沉。\n她蹲下來，分不清自己摸到的是黏稠的血還是潮濕的泥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
